        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Orb of Mastery – LvL 46 spell<BR>Part I<BR>Find Rykas – Lake Rathe  -- <BR>	Quest: Find Words of Magi’kot, Power of the Elements, and Words of Mastery<BR>	Given: Token of Mastery<BR>	Once complete: Give all three items to Rykas<BR>	Given: Power of the Orb*(End of Part I)</P><P>Words of Magi’kot<BR>Find Jahson Aksot – West Commons – <BR>	Give: Token of Mastery – Received from Rykas<BR>	Quest: Find – Torn Pages of Magi’kot<BR>		Page 1 – Off Enraged Dread Wolves – Kithicor Forest/Night (40+)  <BR>		Page 2 – Off Tentacle Terrors – Estate of Unrest (30-33)<BR>		Page 3 – Blood Thirsty Ghoul – Lower Guk (38-42)<BR>	Once complete: Give all Three Torn pages to Jahson<BR>	Given: Words of Magi’Kot</P><P>Power of the Elements<BR>Find Walnan: -- Butcher Block Mountains – Kill Gnome magician @ docks<BR>	Quest: Find – Elemental Powers<BR>		Power of Wind – Gypsie Dancers – Mistmoore (25-26)<BR>		Power of Earth – Farie Guards – Lesser Faydark (24-26)<BR>		Power of Fire – Lava Elemental – Sol A (35-38)<BR>		Power of Water -- Famished Ravener – kaesora (30-33)<BR>	Once Complete: Give all 4 to Walnan<BR>	Given: Power of the Elements</P><P>Words of Mastery<BR>Find Akksstaff – Najena<BR>	Quest: Find – Torn Elemental Pages of Mastery<BR>		Torn Page of Mastery Earth, Wind, Fire, and Earth –magician – Najena<BR>	Once Complete: Give all 4 to Akksstaff<BR>	Given: Words of Mastery</P><P>** Return to Rykas</P><P><BR>Part II (Will not be completed until 55+)</P><P>Note:  Kihun Solstin is the "final" quest NPC do not hand in you items for<BR>the Element of Air until you are ready to go to the Plane of Sky and turn in<BR>all four components to The Master of Elements to obtain the Orb of Mastery.</P><P>Find Jennus Lyklobar – Skyfire Mountains<BR>	Quest: Element of Fire<BR>		Torch of The Elements – The City of Mist – Neh’Ashirr (53-55)<BR>		Burning Embers – Burning Woods – Nezekezena (40-55)<BR>		Blazing Wand – Kedge Keep – Undertow (49)<BR>		Power of the Orb – Received Upon Completion of Part I<BR>	Once Completed: give to Junnus<BR>	Received: Element of Fire</P><P>Find Tiblner Milnik:  Firiona Vie<BR>	Quest: Element of Earth<BR>		Staff of Element Mastery: Earth – Plane of Hate – Innoruuk (55)<BR>		Dirt of Underfoot – Burning Woods – Sllixin Klex (40-55)<BR>		Broom of Trilon – Done<BR>		Shovel of Ponz – Done<BR>	Once Complete: Give to Tiblner<BR>	Received: Element of Earth</P><P>Find Jinalis Andir:  Dagnor’s Cauldron (-447, -2044)<BR>	Quest: Element of Water<BR>		Staff of Elemental Master: Water – Kedge Keep – Phinigel Autroposs (30-50)<BR>		Tears of Erolisi – The Over there – Captain Rottgrime (50-55)<BR>		Rain of Karana –  East Karana – Trabul Earthstider (??)</P><P>Find Kihun Solstin – Plane of Sky<BR>	Quest: Element of Air<BR>		Crown of Elemental Mastery – Plane of Sky – Sphinx<BR>		Elemental Binder – Hole – Elemental Warriors<BR>		Pegasus Feather Cloack – South Karana – Quillmane (28-30)<BR>--------------<BR>I composed something like this up, as a check list for what i need to do, it's easy straight forward and simple.  Now that I am part of a guild hopefully one day someone cand find this useful.  I am also undertaking the quest for the epic quest and have almost completed part I just need two more pieces, which I hope to obtain soon, page 3 of magi'kot and the power of fire.</P><P>Abyn<BR>Magician of the 50th Circle</P><P></P><P>Edited by - Abyn on 13 Mar 2001  16:39:01</font></td>
